# 3. Flow (DAG)

| Task | Timeout (min) | Retries / backoff | Idempotent? (how) |
|---|---|---|---|
| Generate synthetic dataset | 5 | 0 | Yes; fixed seed |
| Validate schema and values | 5 | 0 | Yes; deterministic validation |
| Split train/validation/test | 5 | 0 | Yes; fixed random seed |
| Feature preparation | 5 | 0 | Yes; deterministic logic |
| Train model | 10 | 0 | Yes; fixed configuration |
| Evaluate model | 5 | 0 | Yes; fixed test dataset |
| Export metrics | 2 | 0 | Yes; overwrite output |

---

# 4. Incremental load and backfill

**Watermark column and storage:** Not applicable. Full dataset refresh per execution.

**Late-data window:** 0 days because all data is generated in batch before processing.

**Backfill command and range parameters:** Re-execute full pipeline using the recorded code version and seed.

---

# 5. Validation gates

| Gate | Checks (schema / DQ-###) | On failure | Quarantine location |
|---|---|---|---|
| Input | Required columns present; valid category values; no duplicate complaint_id | Block run | quarantine/input |
| Output | Dataset split integrity; no null target values | Block publish | quarantine/output |
| Reconciliation | rows in = rows out + rows rejected | Block publish | - |

